{
    "title": "Type Sprint: Typing Games",
    "description": "Ready to challenge your brain and typing speed? Type Sprint is one of the most exciting type battles! Join this breathtaking typing race against quick sneaky opponents, go level by level to complete various missions, and become the best type runner. From simple typing games to tricky word trivia \u2014 this texting game has plenty of brain-busting and typing practice!\r\n \r\nType Sprint is packed with match 3 games, word problems, hidden objects, and different riddles that will test your memory, typing speed, and strategic thinking.\r\n\r\nBEST FEATURES:\r\n \r\n5-in-1 type run with levels, fun missions, and rewards. This is one of the best running games you\u2019ll never get tired of!\r\nDynamic and educational typing race. You don\u2019t simply run and type but also improve your texting skills.\r\nAs simple as abc: fun gameplay, easy navigation, and nice design. The type run you'll definitely love!\r\nCrowds of sneaky opponents: from easy-to-defeat losers to smart and skillful type runners. Leave them all behind!\r\nEndless fun type and brain-pushing games. Not just play\u2014think!\r\n \r\nGreat time filler and excellent typing practice. Texting games have never been so addictive!\r\n \r\nHave fun running, typing like a pro, and beating every level in one of the most popular typing games. Become the master of fast typing and enjoy this running game for free, and we\u2019ll be keeping a keen eye on your feedback to make it the best texting game ever. We can\u2019t wait for your review to hear what you think!",
